// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\drosemann\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":19,"newStart":1,"newLines":8,"lines":["-# Hey, I'm Daniel","-","-Dev by passion. Based near Frankfurt am Main. Currently in my second year of training as an IT specialist for system integration (FISI).","-","-I live for tech, infrastructure, and AI. Learning by doing has always been my thing — I'd rather build a server than a slide deck. I've been active in the Minecraft and hosting community for years, and most of what I know, I learned by just trying things until they worked.","-","-A lot of that time went into messing around with Linux and installing what felt like every distro imaginable, from Ubuntu to Gentoo. No, I never tried Linux From Scratch, and honestly, I probably never will.","-","-These days I run my own infrastructure with Docker, Proxmox, and KVM — pure Docker over panels, less overhead, more control. My stack is HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Java, PHP, and Python, with MariaDB, NGINX, and Cloudflare around it. On the client side I'm still on Windows (looking at you, games industry) — a full switch to Linux is planned as soon as anticheat support gets better.","-","-Since 2018 I've been running [ShadowUnity](https://shadowunity.de), my Minecraft server — no reset since 2022. Before my apprenticeship I did three helpdesk internships, all unpaid, all just for the joy of it, and produced over 2,000 YouTube videos along the way.","-","-Long term, I want to build my own thing: an IT company for hosting, infrastructure, and consulting. Buy an old house, make it smart the cheap way, and document all of it.","-","-Open to collabs in IT, AI, hosting, gaming, and software dev. If you want to build something real — reach out.","-","----","-","-**Elsewhere:** [d5niel.de](https://d5niel.de) · [shadowunity.de](https://shadowunity.de) · [Video archive — Theo Browne era](https://github.com/drosemann/drosemann/tree/main/theo-browne-era-video-style)","+Hey, I'm Daniel, a dev from near Frankfurt am Main and currently in my second year of training as an IT specialist for system integration.","+I care about technology, IT infrastructure and artificial intelligence, and I learn best by building things instead of just talking about them.","+I've been part of the Minecraft and hosting community for years and I've been running my own Minecraft server, ShadowUnity, since 2018.","+Most of my free time goes into my own servers and projects, trying things out until they work the way I want them to.","+Before my training I did three helpdesk internships, all of them unpaid and all of them just because I enjoyed the work.","+I also spent a lot of time on YouTube and streaming, with over 2,000 videos and hundreds of hours live.","+Long term I want to build my own thing, an IT company for hosting, infrastructure and consulting.","+If you want to build something real in IT, AI, hosting, gaming or software development, feel free to reach out."]}]}]}
